const JIHO97 = `A: Excuse me, Ms. Carter. Can I ask you a question? Did I get the main role in the play?\nB: Yes, you did. Congratulations, Jiho! You're going to be Romeo in our school play, Romeo and Juliet.\nA: Really? I'm so excited. Thank you so much, Ms. Carter. (A)\nB: I know how much you wanted the role. (B)\nA: Thank you. What about Sumi? Did she get the role she wanted, too? (C)\nB: Unfortunately, no. She's very disappointed. (D)\nA: Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Anyway, when is the first practice?\nB: It's at 2 p.m. on September 20th, in the acting club room. You'll get a text message about it soon. (E)\nA: OK. I'll be there.`;
