add(R, `다음 대화의 밑줄 친 ⓐ~ⓔ 중, 쓰임이 어색한 것은?\n\n1.\nTom: Sue, you look excited. What's up?\nSue: I was elected ⓐ<u>as</u> class president. I'm so excited.\nTom: That's wonderful. Congratulations!\nSue: Thanks. I'm really happy to have a chance to work ⓑ<u>for</u> my class.\n\n2.\nKate: John, congratulations ⓒ<u>by</u> winning the gold medal ⓓ<u>in</u> the school marathon.\nJohn: Thanks, Kate. I'm very happy.\nKate: You must be very proud ⓔ<u>of</u> yourself.\nJohn: Yes, I am. I did my best.`, '3', CIRCLE);
